<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Any officer of customs shall have the duties and powers to enforce and ensure due compliance with the provisions of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
