<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "No person having any official duty or being appointed or employed under this Act or who is referred to in subsection 8(1) shall be required to produce in any matters or proceedings in any court or tribunal any document, information, return or declaration or to divulge or communicate in the matters or proceedings of any matter or thing, coming under his notice in the performance of his duties under this Act, except as may be necessary for the purposes of carrying into effect the provisions of this Act or in order to institute a prosecution or in the course of a prosecution for any offence committed under this Act. Director General may transmit, etc., document etc."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
