<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_IX__cl_46> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding any written law to the contrary, a Sessions Court shall have jurisdiction to try any offence under this Act and to impose punishment for the offence under this Act for such offence. Evidential provisions"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
