<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_IX__cl_49__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_IX__cl_49> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
