<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_IX__cl_49__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "where the fine exceeds ten thousand ringgit but does not exceed twenty thousand ringgit, the maximum period shall be six months; with two additional months for every ten thousand ringgit after the first twenty thousand ringgit of the fine until a maximum period of six years is reached. No costs or damages arising from seizure to be recoverable unless seizure without reasonable or probable cause"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
