<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_IX__cl_50> <https://schema.org/text> "No person shall in any proceedings before any court in respect of the seizure of any thing seized in the exercise or the purported exercise of any power conferred under this Act, be entitled to the costs of the proceedings or to any damages or other relief other than an order for the return of the thing or the payment of the value unless the seizure was made without reasonable or probable cause. Compounding of offences"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
