<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_IX__cl_51__subsec_1__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "the criteria for compounding such offence; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_IX__cl_51__subsec_1__para_c> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_IX__cl_51__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
