<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_V__cl_17__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_V__cl_17__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any record kept under this section shall be preserved for a period of seven years from the latest date to which the record relates."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_V__cl_17__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_V__cl_17> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_V__cl_17__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_V__cl_17__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_V__cl_17__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the record is in an electronically readable form, the record shall be kept in such manner as to enable the record to be readily accessible and convertible into writing."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_V__cl_17__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_V__cl_17> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_V__cl_17__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
