<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_V__cl_17__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the record is originally in a manual form and is subsequently converted into an electronic form, the record shall be retained in its original form prior to the conversion."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_V__cl_17__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_V__cl_17> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
