<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_V__cl_17__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Any registered person who contravenes this section commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding one hundred thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding one year or to both. Copy of record admissible in evidence"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
