<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_V__cl_26> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_V__cl_26> <https://schema.org/text> "The Director General may make any alteration in or addition to any assessment made as he deems fit to ensure the correctness thereof and shall forthwith notify the registered person in writing. Power to collect departure levy, etc., from persons owing money to registered person"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
