<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_XI__cl_63__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Director General may register the person referred to in subsection (1) on or after the effective date."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_XI__cl_63__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_XI__cl_63> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
