<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_X__cl_56__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Where an electronic notice is made and transmitted to the Director General, the Director General shall not be liable for any loss or damage suffered by the registered user by reason of any error or omission of whatever nature or however arising appearing in any electronic notice obtained by the registered user under the electronic service if the error or omission was made in good faith and in the ordinary course of the discharge of the duties of the Director General or occurred or arose as a result of any defect or breakdown in the service or in the equipment used for the provision of the service."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
