<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_X__cl_56__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Any electronic notice made and transmitted by the registered user shall be deemed to have been filed, furnished or served at the time the electronic notice is received by the Director General."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_X__cl_56__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_X__cl_56> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
