<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_X__cl_57__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to subsection (2), every notice or any other document served for the purposes of this Act by the Director General or an officer authorized by him shall be sufficiently authenticated if the name and office of the Director General is printed, stamped or otherwise written thereon."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_X__cl_57__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_X__cl_57> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
