<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_X__cl_57__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "A notice or any other document served for the purposes of this Act and purporting to be signed in manuscript by the Director General or an officer authorized by him shall be presumed, until the contrary is proved, to have been so signed. Transaction of business on behalf of registered person"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
