<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_X__cl_60__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Any liquidator who fails to comply with subsection (1) shall be guilty of an offence and shall on conviction be liable to a fine not exceeding one hundred thousand ringgit or imprisonment for a term not exceeding one year or to both."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
