<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@/~part_X__cl_61__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A person appointed as receiver who fails to give notice to the Director General within the time specified in subsection (1) or fails to provide for payment of the departure levy as required by that subsection shall be personally liable for any departure levy that is or will become due and payable as aforesaid."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/8/eng@> .
